{"timestamp": "2026-11-07T09:53:50.638Z", "ordinal": 12, "type": "event_msg", "payload": {"type": "item_completed", "thread_id": "01a1b56d-9ff7-7a32-b4f2-f4022b838014", "turn_id": "01a1b56d-ab47-7bd1-8ff7-f33328bce42e", "item": {"type": "UserMessage", "id": "01a1b56d-be2c-7990-8da2-717379538f25", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "<task>\n实现当前目录 slug.js 中的 slugify(input) 函数。\n改动范围：只改 slug.js；不要改 slug.test.js，不要新增文件，不要提交。保持 module.exports = { slugify } 的导出形式（CommonJS）。\n要求：转小写、去首尾空白、连续的非字母数字字符合并为一个连字符、首尾不留连字符。\n验收标准：\n1. slugify(\"Hello World\") → \"hello-world\"\n2. slugify(\"  Hello  \") → \"hello\"\n3. slugify(\"foo---bar___baz\") → \"foo-bar-baz\"\n4. slugify(\"--Hello, World!--\") → \"hello-world\"\n5. slugify(\"\") → \"\"\n6. slugify(\"!!!\") → \"\"\n验证命令：node --test\n</task>\n<output>\n列出改动的文件、做出的关键决定、验证命令的实际结果。没跑成功就如实说，不要声称通过。\n</output>", "text_elements": []}]}, "started_at_ms": 1794045230638, "completed_at_ms": 1794045230638}}
